WEBVTT

00:12:00.215 --> 00:12:02.634
I twerk because it’s as natural
to me as breathing.

00:12:02.634 --> 00:12:04.344
Black women invented twerking,

00:12:04.344 --> 00:12:06.221
and twerking is part of the revolution.

00:12:06.472 --> 00:12:07.681
We’ve been doing it,

00:12:07.681 --> 00:12:09.266
we’re going to keep on doing it

00:12:09.266 --> 00:12:12.644
because we have
and always will be the blueprint.

00:12:14.813 --> 00:12:17.858
(Applause and cheers)

00:12:20.402 --> 00:12:23.238
We twerk to remind ourselves we here,

00:12:23.238 --> 00:12:24.948
and we ain’t going nowhere.

00:12:25.324 --> 00:12:26.950
So in the case of optimism,

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:29.703
I want everyone to stand up
and shake some ass with me.